     "explanation": "Holiday's key insight is that ego is **the lens, not the object** — you cannot see your own ego from inside because it has already shaped what you perceive. By the time you 'notice' a situation, ego has already cast you as the hero, dismissed contrary evidence, and rigged the comparison. That's why he prescribes external practices (journaling, mentors, brutal-honesty friends) — they are the only way to see what the lens distorts.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Why ego is so hard to see</text>\n                    <circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"500\" r=\"200\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"32\">THE LENS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Not the object</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"780\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Ego shapes what you perceive</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">before you can perceive it.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">External practices are the only way to see around the lens.</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Why catching ego requires outside help"
     }
