     "explanation": "Holiday repeatedly contrasts these two: **confidence is earned and stable** — it rests on evidence (1,000 reps, real results) and can absorb a hit. **Ego is assumed and brittle** — it rests on a belief about your own specialness that has not been tested, so any criticism feels like an existential threat. The other options conflate ego with personality type or context, but Holiday is clear: it's a structural difference in what holds the self-image up.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Confidence vs ego — structural difference</text>\n                    <rect x=\"60\" y=\"200\" width=\"480\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">CONFIDENCE</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Foundation: EVIDENCE</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Under criticism: bends</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">After failure: learns</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">STABLE</text>\n                    <rect x=\"560\" y=\"200\" width=\"480\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">EGO</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Foundation: BELIEF</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Under criticism: shatters</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">After failure: blames</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">BRITTLE</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"640\" width=\"900\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.08)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE TEST IS CRITICISM</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Confidence says: \"Is that true? Let me look.\"</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Ego says: \"How dare they.\"</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Watch your own reaction. That is the diagnostic.</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "The diagnostic question: how do you respond to criticism?"
     }
