     "explanation": "Holiday's contrast is **structural**, not temperamental or temporal. Both men had immense success. Hughes used his power to remove every voice that might disagree (yes-men aides, fired executives, paranoid isolation). Genghis used his power to **structurally retain** disagreement (Yelü Chucai, merit promotion, foreign engineers, religious debates). The lesson generalizes: at scale, what matters is what you do to your feedback environment.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The Hughes / Genghis contrast</text>\n                    <rect x=\"60\" y=\"200\" width=\"480\" height=\"480\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">HUGHES</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Used power to REMOVE truth</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Fired executives</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Hand-picked yes-men</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Paranoid isolation</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Personal control of detail</text>\n                    <text x=\"300\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Empire collapses with him</text>\n                    <rect x=\"560\" y=\"200\" width=\"480\" height=\"480\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">GENGHIS</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Used power to RETAIN truth</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Kept Yelü Chucai</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Merit promotion</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Foreign engineers</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Inter-faith debates</text>\n                    <text x=\"800\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Empire outlasts him</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"720\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE PATTERN</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">At scale, what matters is what you do</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">to your feedback environment.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Build it to correct you — or to flatter you.</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Structural choice — not personality"
     }
